        {
          "hash": "6a5bc7cd893ceb04b16016b5bf586971f3ad8da7",
          "authoredAt": "2026-08-02T14:59:47-04:00",
          "title": "balancing: spells and attributes",
          "description": "Key changes:\n\n  - Removed the accidental Intelligence + Agility cooldown divisor that\ncaused sub-second spam.\n  - Ordinary cooldowns now have a 40% minimum multiplier; combined\ncooldown reduction caps at 60%.\n  - Bash: 6–3s cooldown.\n  - Healing: 18–6s cooldown.\n  - Whirlwind: 18s cooldown, 3–12s duration.\n  - Orbiting Hammers: 12s cooldown, 6 Mana, 2.4–10s duration.\n  - Thunder Aura: minimum 3s pulse; damage now scales with Magic.\n  - Sunburn: maximum 2% HP every 2s; damage now scales with Magic.\n  - Time Harvest: 0.25–2s reduction per kill.\n  - Spirit Wounds: maximum 25% conversion.\n  - Penance: maximum 30% conversion.\n  - Blocking: 0.5% chance per level.\n  - Attraction: 0.25% Gold/Magic Find per level.\n\n  Attributes now have clearer roles:\n\n  - Strength: physical damage, HP, Rage.\n  - Agility: handling, cast speed, critical chance capped at 50%.\n  - Magic: 2.5% magic amplification per point.\n  - Intelligence: Mana, 2% critical damage and 0.5% cooldown reduction\nper point.\n  - Spirit: regeneration and spell/aura range.\n\n  Specs, runtime logic, HUD projections, descriptions, and regression\ntests were synchronized."
        },
