      "summaryTitle": "Feature & Balance Overhaul",
      "summary": "Implemented significant changes to spell mechanics, cooldowns, and attribute systems. This included balancing various spells like Whirlwind and Orbiting Hammers, adjusting damage scaling based on Magic for abilities such as Thunder Aura and Sunburn, updating stamina mechanics, and redefining attribute roles (Strength, Agility, Magic, Intelligence, Spirit). Cooldown calculations were refined to prevent spamming, and new spell features like blizzard were introduced.",
